/github.com/vuejs/core/issues/11871#issuecomment-2340215178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/11871","id":2340215178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCCum186LfNmK","user":{"login":"palasjir","id":1304211,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDQyMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1304211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir","html_url":"https://github.com/palasjir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palasjir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-09-10T09:59:49Z","updated_at":"2024-09-10T09:59:49Z","body":"Ok (1) and (3) might be ok with the order of mount. I probably had a false perception how this works. But (1) still seems incorrect to me how `setup` is called. Like this It's for example not possible to use `provide/inject` properly.\r\n\r\nAlso I have found that setup and onMounted is called even when component is not rendered eg. \r\n```\r\n<!-- Comp 1 -->\r\n\r\n<template>\r\n  <div v-if=\"false\">\r\n      <slot />\r\n   </div>\r\n</template>\r\n```  \r\n[Reproduced in playground here](https://play.vuejs.org/#) this all seems to be related\r\n\r\nMaybe i fundamentally missunderstand something about usage of web components but his feels to be quite wrong.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/2340215178/reactions"